<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 7,566 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 3,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  138   (135 and 126)</p>
<p>    Good		unq   (unq and 113)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     128   (128 and 108)</p>
<p>    Medium	    123   (120 and  95)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 95    (88 and  82)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 130 pence for a Malawi PF.1</p>
</text>
